Package: rngat
Title: Random Access Random Numbers via Counter-Based Generation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic random access random number generation using the
    Philox counter-based generator from the 'Random123' library by Salmon,
    Moraes, Dror and Shaw (2011) <doi:10.1145/2063384.2063405>. Random values
    are addressed by a key, an index and an optional domain instead of being
    produced from mutable generator state, so any value can be recomputed
    independently, in any order, on any platform. Independent keys for
    substreams can be derived deterministically with fold_in().
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
Encoding: UTF-8
